<title>RUSSIA: WACO names Russia's Icaros as CIS agent.</title>
<headline>WACO names Russia's Icaros as CIS agent.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Air Cargo Organisation (WACO) appointed private Russian freight forwarder Icaros International Cargo Service as its official agent in CIS states, the head of the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Moscow-based Icaros was established in 1993 and provides import-export air, land, ocean and rail cargo operations, managing director Lilia Sirbu told Reuters. The company also covers customs clearence and door-to-door delivery of cargoes.</p>
<p>Icaros is an agent for Aviatrans which operates international and domestic cargo charters and has its own terminal in Moscow's Domodedovo airport.</p>
<p>-- Viktor Anoshkin, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
